#19101
The Boarding Ramp~
   You stand upon a narrow rampway which leads upward toward the ship's main
deck. As you climb, carefully avoiding the places where boards are missing or
broken, you note a large metal plaque affixed to the ship's bow. The letters
are difficult to make out through the layer of tarnish. The main deck lies
above.
