#19102
Climbing the Mainmast~
   As you take your next step, suddenly the ladder gives way beneath your
weight. You struggle to maintain your hold as your body slams into the mast,
your feet dangling in the air. You'd best move quickly to a place with more
stable footing. The ladder continues up and down from here.
