#19121
The Ship's Helm~
   From a raised platform at the helm, you have an elevated view of the main
deck. Here, there is no dust on the floor, and the place is relatively clean.
Below the ancient wheel you see a torn section of a map - no doubt the captain
was looking at this long ago. Alongside, a large bullhorn carved from fine
ivory. Using this, the captain could surely be heard over the din of any storm.
The quarter deck extends to the north, south, and west.
